STATEMENT: >>>
scribe has no --dry-run: the sdoc skill promises every writing verb takes
--dry-run, but scribe_cmd.py (the daemon client) exposes none; sdoc_cli.py
has it. Found 2026-09-02 verifying element/id refusal; a bogus-id relate
could only be tested safely on sdoc_cli.py.
